1Jo 2:1 , He comforts them against the sins of infirmity;
1Jo 2:3 , Rightly to know God is to keep his commandments;
1Jo 2:9 , to love our brethren;
1Jo 2:15 , and not to love the world;
1Jo 2:18 , We must beware of seducers;
1Jo 2:20 , from whose deceits the godly are safe, preserved by perseverance in faith, and holiness of life.
